
Once you have unlharc'd the files, please move them ALL over to a floppy 
disk. Name that disk 'VBBS'. To install all the files on your hard drive
please read the VBBSInstall docs. Please report any problems. Please try
to keep all programs and documentation complete. This way the next person
who tries VBBSDisk will have easy time setting it up.

VBBSDisk.lzh

Version 1.0 - Contains: Term V62, Age V2, Read V11, VBBSReader V1.52
                        VBBSInstall V1.0, VBBSMenu V1.0

Version 2.0 - Contains: Term V63, Age V2, Read V11, VBBSReader V1.52
                        VBBSInstall V1.1, VBBSMenu V1.1

Version 3.0 - Contains: Term V63, Age V2, Read V13, VBBSReader V1.53
                        VBBSInstall V1.2, VBBSMenu V1.2

Version 4.0 - Contains: Term V64, Age V2, Read V17, VBBSReader V1.6
                        VBBSInstall V1.2, VBBSMenu V1.2

Version 5.0 - Contains: Term V65, Age V2, Read V17, VBBSReader V1.61
                        VBBSInstall V1.2, VBBSMenu V1.3

NOTE: I've changed the default setting of Term (inside the tooltypes) so
      it will now set your clock to the same time as your calling BBS.
      If you don't want this, then delete this entry from the TERM tooltype.

